#%PAM-1.0
# Blackroom Console remote login. Used only by pam-auth-helper (run by remote-hostd as the owner).
# It checks the owner's own Linux password through pam_unix and nothing else: no session is opened,
# no password can be changed, no other module (fingerprint, keyring, network) is consulted.
auth     required   pam_unix.so
account  required   pam_unix.so
